      ":question/worked-solution": "To plot $y=-\\frac{1}{2x},$ we apply the following steps:\n\n- Take the curve $y=-\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/92/92f4dd2401393587aa8c816836b917e005b66cb052662148d333e9a1c0586d73.png)\n\n- Stretch the result by a scale factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$ parallel to the $y$-axis to get the graph of $y=-\\frac{1}{2x}.$\n\n![](images/b3/b37f61bb3684f1c57e19fc8c480717631f945195d81336e7096c9ece6593b042.png)",
